@*
    View Explanation:

    Views are responsible for displaying UI to the user.
    They receive data from the Controller (via Model/ViewModel)
    and send user input back through forms.

    Flow:
    Controller ? View (display)
    View ? Controller (form submission)
*@

@{
    // Sets the page title
    ViewData["Title"] = "Access Denied";
}

<div class="panel" style="max-width: 560px;">
    <h1 class="page-title mb-2">Access denied</h1> <!-- Main heading shown on the page -->
    <p class="text-muted">Your account does not have permission to view this page.</p> <!-- Explains why access is blocked -->
    <a class="btn btn-primary" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">Go to dashboard</a> <!-- Redirect button to dashboard -->
</div>